1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,320
This is Fitness Blender's Brutal Hit Ladder Workout.

2
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:14,440
In this routine, we're gonna start off

3
00:00:14,440 --> 00:00:16,080
with a quick three minute warmup,

4
00:00:16,080 --> 00:00:17,120
and we're gonna follow it up

5
00:00:17,120 --> 00:00:20,840
with a 17 minute descending ladder style hit workout.

6
00:00:20,840 --> 00:00:23,040
Now you're not gonna need any equipment for this routine,

7
00:00:23,040 --> 00:00:25,840
so let's go ahead and get started with our cardio warmup.

8
00:00:26,840 --> 00:00:30,440
Our first exercise is gonna be leg swings.

9
00:00:30,440 --> 00:00:33,200
We're gonna be doing this for 30 seconds on each leg.

10
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:35,440
Let's go ahead and start with that right leg first.

11
00:00:35,440 --> 00:00:37,720
Nice small range of motion to start out with,

12
00:00:37,720 --> 00:00:39,240
and then as you feel more comfortable with it,

13
00:00:39,240 --> 00:00:41,080
start increasing that range of motion.

14
00:00:41,080 --> 00:00:42,720
Now this is a relatively quick motion.

15
00:00:42,720 --> 00:00:45,760
You wanna try to really open that hip up as best you can,

16
00:00:45,760 --> 00:00:47,980
but remember you always wanna keep it under control.

17
00:00:47,980 --> 00:00:50,000
Don't swing out of control.

18
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:51,640
You wanna reach across with that left hand

19
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:53,160
to your right foot to get that torso

20
00:00:53,160 --> 00:00:54,160
to rotate just a little bit.

21
00:00:54,160 --> 00:00:56,080
Let's start warming up that core a little bit more.

22
00:00:56,080 --> 00:00:57,560
Got five seconds left.

23
00:01:00,200 --> 00:01:01,040
And switch.

